<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1036].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1036&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;EGGC LIQUID MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Glucose                                                 </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.6&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Sodium acetate                                          </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Casamino acids (BD-Difco)                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCO<sub>3</sub>                                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.02&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Solution A (see below)                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Solution B (see below)                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;8.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Adjust pH to 7.0 - 7.2. Autoclave at 115C for 20 min. Separately sterilize Solution B by filtration and add to the medium aseptically.   <br>
<I>Solution A:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> (NH<sub>4</sub>)<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>                                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;20.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                 </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl                                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;4.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
<I>Solution B:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 0.5 M Na<sub>2</sub>HPO<sub>4</sub>-NaH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub> buffer (pH 7.3)      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamins mix solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=296">296</a>)            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> FeCl<sub>3</sub> solution (see below)                           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix and filter-sterilize just before addition to the medium.  <br>
<I>FeCl<sub>3</sub> solution:</I>  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> FeCl<sub>3</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.15&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;300.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Prepare just before use.       <br>
